---
// FisioLaunchSection.astro - Seção de Lançamento Oficial: Pluri Fisio
---

<section
  id="pluri-fisio"
  aria-labelledby="pluri-fisio-titulo"
  class="snap-page fisio-launch-section"
>
  <div class="fisio-launch-container">
    
    <!-- Top Eyebrow & Badges -->
    <div class="fisio-top-meta">
      <span class="launch-tag-pill">
        <span class="pill-spark">✨</span>
        <span>PRIMEIRA VERTICAL DA PLURI HEALTH</span>
      </span>
      <span class="live-pill">Disponível Agora</span>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Section Content -->
    <div class="fisio-content-grid">
      
      <!-- Left Column: Copy & CTAs -->
      <div class="fisio-text-col">
        <h2 id="pluri-fisio-titulo" class="fisio-heading">
          Apresentamos o <strong>Pluri Fisio</strong>.
        </h2>
        <p class="fisio-subheading">
          A solução pensada exclusivamente para a rotina dinâmica de quem atende na maca. 
          Evolução em menos de 90 segundos, atalho para WhatsApp em 1 clique e gestão descomplicada de pacotes.
        </p>

        <!-- Feature Points -->
        <div class="fisio-highlights-list">
          <div class="highlight-item">
            <div class="highlight-icon">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <strong>Evolução Ultraveloz na Maca</strong>
              <p>Botão de duplicar atendimento anterior para salvar tempo entre pacientes.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="highlight-item">
            <div class="highlight-icon">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <strong>Controle Inteligente de Pacientes & Sessões</strong>
              <p>Dedução de planos, histórico de absenteísmo e relatórios transparentes.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Call to Action Buttons -->
        <div class="fisio-actions-area">
          <a
            href="https://plurifisio.com.br"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener"
            class="btn-clay fisio-cta-btn"
          >
            <span>Acessar plurifisio.com.br</span>
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <line x1="7" y1="17" x2="17" y2="7"></line>
              <polyline points="7 7 17 7 17 17"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </a>
          <a
            href="https://plurifisio.com.br/planos"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener"
            class="btn-ghost fisio-secondary-btn"
          >
            <span>Experimentar Grátis</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="fisio-trust-strip">
          <span>✨ 20 atendimentos inclusos no teste</span>
          <span class="sep">•</span>
          <span>Sem cartão de crédito</span>
          <span class="sep">•</span>
          <span>Migração gratuita</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Card Preview Graphic -->
      <div class="fisio-preview-col">
        <div class="preview-card-frame">
          <div class="preview-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <img
            src="/images/card_fisio.jpg"
            alt="Interface do Pluri Fisio com recursos ortopédicos, escala EVA e gestão de sessões"
            class="preview-card-image"
            width="460"
            height="340"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <div class="preview-floating-card">
            <div class="floating-icon">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#0072FF" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"></path><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <strong>Pluri Fisio Ativo</strong>
              <p>Edição 100% dedicada a Fisioterapia</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .fisio-launch-section {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100svh;
    min-height: 100svh;
    max-height: 100svh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 85% 20%, #EBF4FF 0%, #FAFBFD 55%, #F4F8FC 100%);
    padding: clamp(1rem, 3vh, 2.5rem) clamp(1rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .fisio-launch-container {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1320px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: clamp(0.75rem, 2vh, 1.5rem);
  }

  .fisio-top-meta {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .launch-tag-pill {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 114, 255, 0.2);
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 114, 255, 0.08);
    padding: 0.35rem 0.85rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: clamp(0.7rem, 1.4vmin, 0.78rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: #0066F5;
  }

  .live-pill {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    background: #10B981;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    padding: 0.3rem 0.75rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .fisio-content-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 0.95fr;
    gap: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
    align-items: center;
  }

  .fisio-text-col {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: clamp(0.6rem, 1.5vh, 1.1rem);
    text-align: left;
  }

  .fisio-heading {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.85rem, 4.4vmin, 3.1rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.12;
    color: var(--foreground);
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .fisio-heading strong {
    color: #0066F5;
  }

  .fisio-subheading {
    font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 1.9vmin, 1.15rem);
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    max-width: 48ch;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .fisio-highlights-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    margin-block: 0.2rem;
  }

  .highlight-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .highlight-icon {
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #E0F2FE;
    color: #0072FF;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  .highlight-item strong {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--foreground);
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 2px;
  }

  .highlight-item p {
    font-size: 0.84rem;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    line-height: 1.4;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .fisio-actions-area {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-top: 0.4rem;
  }

  .fisio-cta-btn {
    min-height: 3.1rem !important;
    padding-inline: 1.75rem !important;
    font-weight: 600 !important;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 114, 255, 0.25);
    background: #0066F5 !important;
  }

  .fisio-secondary-btn {
    min-height: 3.1rem !important;
    padding-inline: 1.5rem !important;
  }

  .fisio-trust-strip {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-top: 0.2rem;
  }

  .fisio-trust-strip .sep {
    opacity: 0.4;
  }

  /* Preview Graphic */
  .fisio-preview-col {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .preview-card-frame {
    position: relative;
    border-radius: 1.5rem;
    padding: 0.5rem;
    background: #FFFFFF;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 48px rgba(0, 102, 245, 0.14);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 102, 245, 0.15);
    max-width: 480px;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .preview-glow {
    position: absolute;
    inset: -15px;
    border-radius: 2rem;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(0, 114, 255, 0.25) 0%, transparent 70%);
    z-index: -1;
    filter: blur(20px);
  }

  .preview-card-image {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: 1.25rem;
    display: block;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .preview-floating-card {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -15px;
    left: 20px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 114, 255, 0.2);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 0.65rem 1rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
  }

  .floating-icon {
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: #EBF4FF;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .preview-floating-card strong {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #0F172A;
    display: block;
  }

  .preview-floating-card p {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: #64748B;
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .fisio-content-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1.25rem;
    }

    .fisio-preview-col {
      display: none;
    }

    .fisio-subheading {
      max-width: 100%;
    }
  }
</style>
